			"content": "<p>The other lesson here is in the real consequences of maintainers (even those with a small following) airing small dev grievances on Twitter (Svelte/SvelteKit in this case).</p><p>The parasitically harmful YouTube JavaScript influencer ecosystem feeds on small drama like this, resulting in elevated abuse toward well-intentioned maintainers—pretty gross all around.</p>",
