			"date": "2024-06-27T13:53:45.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> TIL Baseline! Which feels like it's for the web what is <a href=\"https://wintercg.org\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"\">wintercg.org</span><span class=\"invisible\"></span></a> for edge/cloud/embedded. Maybe with time we will have more standards (and more standard recognition/tooling) for this, and I agree that would get us into a whole lotta better place.</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
